<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Show All</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from the <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu &gt; Show All</b></span><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>,</b></span> from <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>View &gt; Show All</b></span>, or by pressing <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Shift + S</b></span>.</p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Show All</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command displays all hidden entities (or those parts of them that are hidden.)</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If the command is called from</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>View</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">menu or by shortcut key, it displays everything in the scene that is hidden  entities and parts them.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
