<p><span lang="EN-GB">If the command is called from the tree context menu, it displays marked entities. See</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../User_Interface/Tree_Context_Menus.htm">Tree Context Menus</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">for details about marking tree items. If applied to a group, all its hidden entities will appear, no matter if they are selected or not. This command is always active in the context menus regardless of the state (hidden/unhidden, selected/unselected) of the items to which it is applied.</span></p>
